+/**
+ * Records one failed delivery attempt for `entry` and decides what happens next: a classified,
+ * still-retryable failure under the attempt budget is rescheduled (attempt_count incremented,
+ * next_attempt_at set, lease cleared); a terminal failure, or one that has now exhausted its
